From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psigod <psigod@example.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:36:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] lk2nd: boot: Choose the extlinux label from the menu and
 fastboot

Devices with more than one operating system have one extlinux label for
each, and lk2nd always boots the default one. Show the labels as the
first entries of the fastboot menu, and add 'fastboot oem boot-label
<label>' to boot one from a computer.

Both stop fastboot before booting like Continue does, and reboot (into
the default label) if the label cannot be booted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: psigod <psigod@example.com>
